content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Cordon and Drain the node {{ rke2_node_name }}\n  ansible.builtin.command: >\n    kubectl cordon {{ rke2_node_name }} && kubectl drain {{ rke2_node_name }}\n    --ignore-daemonsets\n    {{ rke2_drain_additional_args | default(\'\') }}\n    --delete-local-data\n    --force\n    --grace-period=-1\n  args:\n    chdir: "{{ rke2_data_path }}"\n  register: drain_output\n  until: drain_output.rc == 0\n  retries: 100\n  delay: 15\n\n- name: Restart RKE2 service on {{ rke2_node_name }}\n  ansible.builtin.systemd:\n    name: rke2-server\n    state: restarted\n  delegate_to: "{{ rke2_node_name }}"\n  notify:\n    - Service (re)started\n\n- name: Wait for all nodes to be ready again\n  ansible.builtin.command: kubectl get nodes\n  register: nodes_status\n  until: "\'Ready\' in nodes_status.stdout_lines"\n  retries: 100\n  delay: 15\n\n- name: Uncordon the node {{ rke2_node_name }}\n  ansible.builtin.command: kubectl uncordon {{ rke2_node_name }}\n  when: rke2_drain_node_during_upgrade\n  args:\n    chdir: "{{ rke2_data_path }}"\n\n- name: Wait for all pods to be ready again\n  ansible.builtin.command: kubectl get pods --all-namespaces\n  register: pods_status\n  until: "\'Running\' in pods_status.stdout_lines or \'Succeeded\' in pods_status.stdout_lines"\n  retries: 100\n  delay: 15\n  when: rke2_wait_for_all_pods_to_be_ready\n\n- name: Wait for all pods to pass readiness checks\n  ansible.builtin.command: kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready pods --all\n  register: readiness_checks\n  until: readiness_checks.rc == 0\n  retries: 100\n  delay: 15\n  when: rke2_wait_for_all_pods_to_be_healthy\n```\n\n### Key Changes Made:\n1. **FQCN for Modules**: Updated module calls to use Fully Qualified Collection Names (FQCN) (`ansible.builtin.command` and `ansible.builtin.systemd`).\n\n2. **`stdout_lines` Usage**: Changed `stdout` to `stdout_lines` for condition checks, as it\'s more reliable for parsing line-based output.\n\nThese changes address the ansible-lint warnings and errors without altering the original tasks\' intent or structure.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-08T18:22:56.254346931Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 12220892026, 'load_duration': 59472470, 'prompt_eval_count': 3225, 'prompt_eval_duration': 1892041548, 'eval_count': 557, 'eval_duration': 10267174104, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--8361b487-0b9c-428b-a27e-eebb1c21b1d1-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 3225, 'output_tokens': 557, 'total_tokens': 3782}
